LLM Request Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI
    participant ProxyLlmClient
    participant Server
    participant AnthropicAPI

    CLI->>ProxyLlmClient: complete_streaming(request)
    ProxyLlmClient->>Server: POST /llm/stream
    Note over Server: Route to provider

    Server->>AnthropicAPI: POST /v1/messages
    Server->>Server: Stream SSE events

    loop For each chunk
        AnthropicAPI-->>Server: data chunk
        Server-->>ProxyLlmClient: SSE event
        ProxyLlmClient->>ProxyLlmClient: Parse delta
        ProxyLlmClient-->>CLI: LlmEvent::TextDelta
        CLI->>CLI: Display to user
    end

    AnthropicAPI-->>Server: message_stop
    Server-->>ProxyLlmClient: LlmEvent::Completed
    ProxyLlmClient-->>CLI: LlmResponse